  "date": "1962",
  "content": "The Final Harvest Has Begun: Spirit Children Having a Human Experience (The Principe Collection) (Volume 1) Check it out at: Click Here After a car accident where the car was so mangled they thought I was dead, they heard me moan. I was placed in traction for weeks in Englewood Hospital. My neck and back were injured and I was coughing up blood. I had an out of body experience. It wasn't during an operation, it was while I was in traction. I floated out of my body to the top of the room and then I floated into the hallway down to over the nurse's station and I could hear them speaking. I was very, very scared and yelling at the top of my lungs, 'HELP! HELP!' but they couldn't hear me. The next thing I knew, I was back in my body.\n\nThe Final Harvest Has Begun: Spirit Children Having a Human Experience (The Principe Collection) (Volume 1) Check it out at: Click Here\n\nAfter a car accident where the car was so mangled they thought I was dead, they heard me moan. I was placed in traction for weeks in Englewood Hospital. My neck and back were injured and I was coughing up blood. I had an out of body experience. It wasn't during an operation, it was while I was in traction. I floated out of my body to the top of the room and then I floated into the hallway down to over the nurse's station and I could hear them speaking. I was very, very scared and yelling at the top of my lungs, 'HELP! HELP!' but they couldn't hear me. The next thing I knew, I was back in my body.",
